            </span>
          </label>
          <p class="trip__err trip__err--confirm" data-confirm-err hidden>Please confirm to continue.</p>
        </div>

        <p class="trip__side-total" data-side="protection" hidden>Total: <span data-sum="total2"></span></p>
        <button type="button" class="trip__next" data-next>Next Step</button>
        <p class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" data-live></p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>

  <dialog class="trip__modal" aria-labelledby="tm-h" aria-describedby="tm-p" data-noprot>
    <button type="button" class="trip__modal-x" aria-label="Close" data-modal-close><Icon name="close" width={12} height={12} /></button>
    <h2 class="trip__modal-h" id="tm-h">Continue without ticket protection?</h2>
    <p id="tm-p">You’ve selected No Protection for this trip. Without ticket protection, you won’t have coverage for unexpected changes such as cancellations, missed connections or medical issues.</p>
